From a966920d650bb3c1cc42b91ce8c046086cd64e45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:32:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/15] Round 1: Add the typed score-matrix API

Add Prepared::score_matrix and MatrixScore for untraced row-major
parameter matrices, a GIL-releasing Python score_matrix method and
wrapper, a CRAFT_MATRIX benchmark mode, matrix sides in
performance_pair.py and a --matrix optimization mode. The batch and
matrix paths share budget limits, deadline and worker dispatch.

Workload: serial (96 candidates, one worker), lean scores_json before,
score_matrix after, 11 samples per side.
Before median: 0.114 ms. After median: 0.069 ms. Speedup: 1.65x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
